WEBVTT

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:08.820 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:11.320 --> 00:00:17.870
<i>hoshi ga furishikiru penthouse de
In the penthouse that watches the stars fall...</i>

00:00:17.870 --> 00:00:24.040
<i>sora no ORUGO-RU hitori kiiteta
I listened to Heaven's music box...</i>

00:00:24.540 --> 00:00:30.460
<i>GARASU no RO-PU wo mekakushi de wataru
Walking, blindfolded, across a tight-rope of glass...</i>

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:37.090
<i>minna sabishii SA-KASU no kodomo sa
Everyone is like, the lonely child of the circus.</i>

00:00:38.850 --> 00:00:45.020
<i>hitori bocchi no kanashimi ni
The rope that creaks with the sadness of isolation...</i>

00:00:45.100 --> 00:00:50.770
<i>kishinda tsuna ga kokoro de yureteru...
...is still locked deep in my heart...</i>

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>yasashii me wo shita dareka ni aitai
I wish to meet the one who's eyes glow with warmth!</i>

00:01:14.710 --> 00:01:25.980
<i>sasayaite kureyo soba ni iruyotte Silent Voice
Whisper to me that you'll always be there by my side, Silent Voice.</i>

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:37.060
LEINA'S BLOOD

00:01:32.930 --> 00:01:37.060
(Part 2)

00:01:48.160 --> 00:01:50.570
The GM support unit has launched!

00:01:50.570 --> 00:01:52.990
All right! Maintain altitude
just above sea level!

00:01:52.990 --> 00:01:55.300
Scatter Minovsky particles
to maximum density!

00:02:02.690 --> 00:02:04.710
Is the enemy's reinforcement the Argama?

00:02:04.710 --> 00:02:07.010
No, it's a Garuda-class.

00:02:07.010 --> 00:02:08.430
Destroy it with the main cannons!

00:02:08.430 --> 00:02:09.850
Yes, my lady!

00:02:11.820 --> 00:02:13.690
Lower altitude!

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:23.820
Fire main cannons! Don't let
it use the water as a barrier!

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:31.870
Make no mistake. The spray
will act as a barrier!

00:02:31.870 --> 00:02:34.530
It's no good! The beams are dispersing
too much for a direct hit!

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:38.960
Then launch the missiles! Remember, real
battles don't play out like textbook examples!

00:02:38.960 --> 00:02:41.710
Minovsky particle density is very high.
We can't use our guidance systems.

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:45.550
You don't need the guidance systems!
Aim at the target manually.

00:02:51.930 --> 00:02:55.350
Enemy Garuda is no longer
within firing range.

00:02:55.350 --> 00:02:58.430
That's an impressive feat
for such a large ship.

00:02:58.430 --> 00:02:59.480
Lady Haman!

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:03.270
August Guidan's Dreissen squad is
requesting authorization for launch.

00:03:03.270 --> 00:03:05.900
August? Let them launch!

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:07.030
Yes, my lady.

00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:11.710
Open laser communication channels! It's
time for the fleet in orbit to touch down.

00:03:14.220 --> 00:03:18.590
Hey, can you really figure
out where Judau is like that?

00:03:20.470 --> 00:03:22.540
That way!

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:24.760
Over there! That way!

00:03:25.980 --> 00:03:28.300
W-Which way?

00:03:28.300 --> 00:03:30.720
That way! Over there!

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:32.350
A-All right.

00:03:42.390 --> 00:03:44.230
What?!

00:03:44.230 --> 00:03:46.000
I'm telling you he fell into the sea!

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:47.670
Who fell into the sea?

00:03:47.670 --> 00:03:50.070
I said Judau! Judau! Hurry over here!

00:03:50.070 --> 00:03:51.700
Beecha, let's go look for him!

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:53.710
"Let's go"? At a time like this?

00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:59.840
Damn... dammit!

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:03.880
That's it, Beecha!

00:04:05.270 --> 00:04:06.130
What?

00:04:06.380 --> 00:04:08.550
I'm sorry! We'll borrow this!

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:12.220
- What are you doing?!
- The pilot of the Double Zeta is missing!

00:04:16.530 --> 00:04:19.150
- Beecha, hurry!
- I know!

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:25.370
AMX-009 DREISSEN

00:04:25.370 --> 00:04:28.620
I found you, Gundam!
There is no mistake!

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:31.870
Hold the new enemy units here!

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:48.250
See, there it is! Over
there, the core fighter!

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:49.840
Hot damn, it really is!

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:55.550
Is he inside?

00:04:55.550 --> 00:04:57.060
He is!

00:04:58.350 --> 00:05:00.440
See?

00:05:00.440 --> 00:05:02.190
Judau!

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:04.190
Judau...

00:05:04.190 --> 00:05:07.060
He rescued Leina, too... Look at that!

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:09.360
Judau! What is it?

00:05:09.360 --> 00:05:11.120
Get the medicine box!

00:05:11.120 --> 00:05:12.900
Sure.

00:05:12.900 --> 00:05:15.110
Both of them are hurt.

00:05:15.110 --> 00:05:16.700
Hurry!

00:05:34.520 --> 00:05:35.840
P-Ple?

00:05:36.010 --> 00:05:38.270
Oh, hi!

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:39.680
You came for us?

00:05:39.680 --> 00:05:41.180
Big Brother--

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:43.040
You can't!

00:05:43.040 --> 00:05:44.980
You should let him rest.

00:05:45.660 --> 00:05:48.990
He's tired.... very tired.

00:05:49.500 --> 00:05:52.140
Leina, come with me!

00:05:52.140 --> 00:05:55.790
You can't stay with Judau.
You'll get in his way.

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:56.990
In his way?

00:05:56.990 --> 00:05:59.780
Am I wrong? Judau will
just want to protect you.

00:05:59.950 --> 00:06:03.710
If that happens, Judau will die.

00:06:03.710 --> 00:06:05.250
My big brother will...?!

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:08.590
He's already done a lot of reckless
things trying to rescue you.

00:06:08.590 --> 00:06:11.010
So come together with me. Come on!

00:06:12.810 --> 00:06:14.640
Come on!

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:33.030
There they are!

00:06:45.180 --> 00:06:46.770
Judau!

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:48.840
He came to.

00:06:49.220 --> 00:06:50.580
Leina! Where's Leina?

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:54.250
L-Leina? It looks like
Ple took her somewhere.

00:06:54.250 --> 00:06:55.460
Ple did?

00:06:55.460 --> 00:06:56.850
I think.

00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:03.270
Judau! Don't push yourself too hard!

00:07:03.990 --> 00:07:05.730
Judau!

00:07:06.990 --> 00:07:08.860
It's Elle's group!

00:07:16.960 --> 00:07:19.690
To think that the entire
Gundam Team is together here!

00:07:19.690 --> 00:07:21.240
We're going in, Amatha Pola!

00:07:21.240 --> 00:07:22.610
Yes, sir!

00:07:22.610 --> 00:07:24.420
And the enemy, too!

00:07:25.470 --> 00:07:29.340
You've got to be kidding...
Leina is seriously hurt!

00:07:34.430 --> 00:07:37.670
Judau has to fight right now,

00:07:37.670 --> 00:07:39.460
so we have to go far away.

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:42.310
I understand that, Ple.

00:07:49.320 --> 00:07:50.580
Leina!

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:53.810
I know exactly what you're
thinking, Elpeo Ple!

00:07:53.810 --> 00:07:56.160
I know why you want to be
so close to my big brother.

00:07:56.160 --> 00:07:57.730
What are you talking about?!

00:07:57.730 --> 00:08:00.190
You're a Cyber-Newtype, aren't you?

00:08:00.190 --> 00:08:02.590
A Cyber-Newtype? What's that?

00:08:02.590 --> 00:08:04.990
A Newtype that was
created just to fight.

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:08.370
No, I'm not some kind of weirdo!

00:08:08.370 --> 00:08:09.620
Are you serious, Leina?

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:12.250
I'm the one who's going
to protect my big brother!

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:15.840
You really care about your
big brother, don't you, Leina?

00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:18.170
But...

00:08:21.520 --> 00:08:26.430
I don't have parents or siblings...
so that's why I want Judau!

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:27.430
But you...

00:08:27.430 --> 00:08:31.130
You're lucky, Leina. You can do nothing
and Judau takes good care of you.

00:08:31.130 --> 00:08:34.640
And when you were with Axis,
Glemy took good care of you.

00:08:34.640 --> 00:08:38.650
But he put a creepy machine
on my head every day!

00:08:38.650 --> 00:08:40.950
So you ARE a Cyber-Newtype!

00:08:45.050 --> 00:08:46.960
Leina!

00:08:49.930 --> 00:08:51.620
Which way...?

00:08:51.620 --> 00:08:53.370
Stop that, Ple. This is petty!

00:08:53.370 --> 00:08:58.300
Give me Judau! GIVE HIM! You
already got to be happy!

00:09:04.150 --> 00:09:06.590
Now it's MY turn to be happy.

00:09:06.590 --> 00:09:08.980
So... sorry!

00:09:10.490 --> 00:09:12.350
Stop that, Ple!

00:09:12.350 --> 00:09:14.000
PLE!

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:16.560
Judau, do you love Leina that much?

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:19.450
I love you so, so much, Judau!

00:09:19.870 --> 00:09:21.190
I like you too, Ple.

00:09:21.190 --> 00:09:24.280
Then which one of us do you love more?

00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:25.860
It's not like that!

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:29.780
If you keep asking me things like
that, I'll be forced to hate you, Ple!

00:09:29.780 --> 00:09:33.240
Stop beating around the bush!
If you hate me, then say so!

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:34.700
That's not it!

00:09:34.700 --> 00:09:39.010
Ple, don't we care about
each other because of Leina?

00:09:39.710 --> 00:09:41.000
Because of Leina?

00:09:41.000 --> 00:09:45.570
Right. We're all the same.
All three of us can be siblings.

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:47.630
Can't we, Ple?

00:09:47.630 --> 00:09:48.640
Siblings...

00:09:48.640 --> 00:09:52.850
You don't need to hate each other.
This is all Glemy Toto's fault.

00:09:52.850 --> 00:09:57.520
Glemy taught you how to fight while
he taught Leina how to be a lady.

00:09:57.520 --> 00:10:00.790
It's wrong to discriminate
against people like that.

00:10:00.790 --> 00:10:04.280
And as long as people act like
that, the war will never end.

00:10:04.790 --> 00:10:07.240
So... we should be siblings?

00:10:07.240 --> 00:10:10.870
That's right... What my big
brother just said is right!

00:10:10.870 --> 00:10:13.040
Don't you feel that way too, Ple?

00:10:14.050 --> 00:10:15.380
Ple...

00:10:17.720 --> 00:10:22.760
N-Nobody's ever treats
me like a princess!

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:51.830
- T-This isn't good!
- We'll be shot down if we don't do something!

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:54.780
What happened to Judau?!

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:56.660
He went to go find Leina!

00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:59.090
We gotta transform into the Double Zeta!

00:10:59.560 --> 00:11:02.520
- Go help them, Big Brother.
- But you're hurt!

00:11:02.520 --> 00:11:04.130
I'll be all right.

00:11:04.130 --> 00:11:04.920
But...

00:11:04.920 --> 00:11:08.010
Big Brother, why did you
come all the way out here?

00:11:08.230 --> 00:11:12.730
Were you lying when you said you
were fighting so we could be free?

00:11:14.890 --> 00:11:16.510
More enemy units!

00:11:16.510 --> 00:11:17.930
Big Brother!

00:11:17.930 --> 00:11:19.560
Glemy Toto is a very dangerous man.

00:11:19.560 --> 00:11:21.490
You have to defeat him
now, while you can.

00:11:22.870 --> 00:11:27.780
Judau... I'll take care of
Leina. So go fight for us!

00:11:27.780 --> 00:11:28.820
But...

00:11:28.820 --> 00:11:31.210
The three of us are going
to be together, right?

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:32.580
Ple?

00:11:33.800 --> 00:11:35.030
Hurry!

00:11:35.030 --> 00:11:37.960
Okay. I'm trusting you with Leina!

00:11:50.860 --> 00:11:52.430
Move for me!

00:11:54.930 --> 00:11:56.350
No good...?

00:11:56.350 --> 00:11:58.110
Dammit!

00:11:58.770 --> 00:12:00.980
All right!

00:12:14.630 --> 00:12:17.160
Iino! If you space out,
they'll shoot you down!

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:18.790
I know that!

00:12:19.910 --> 00:12:24.050
If I can shoot them down now, they won't be
able to combine into the Double Zeta.

00:12:27.020 --> 00:12:29.140
You're not shooting down anything!

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:33.800
Judau! Come dock! We need to
combine into the Double Zeta!

00:12:33.800 --> 00:12:35.390
We don't have the Core Base!

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:37.180
Didn't you take both of them?!

00:12:37.180 --> 00:12:39.110
I had to drop it halfway there!

00:12:46.830 --> 00:12:49.030
You dropped the Core Base?!

00:12:50.420 --> 00:12:53.780
- They're missing the Core Base!
- They can't turn into Double Zeta?

00:12:54.030 --> 00:12:56.540
Everyone! Look for the Core Base!

00:12:57.220 --> 00:12:58.620
Who was that?!

00:12:58.620 --> 00:13:00.120
Look for the Core Base?!

00:13:00.120 --> 00:13:01.880
Elle! There's the Core Base!

00:13:03.260 --> 00:13:05.040
It dropped onto the beach!

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:06.670
This way!

00:13:15.320 --> 00:13:17.640
Mondo! Give us a wire!

00:13:17.640 --> 00:13:19.350
- Hurry!
- All right!

00:13:25.350 --> 00:13:28.020
S-So heavy.

00:13:30.670 --> 00:13:32.370
It's the Argama!

00:13:32.370 --> 00:13:34.040
The Argama?!

00:13:34.040 --> 00:13:36.290
The Argama is here...?!

00:13:39.920 --> 00:13:41.780
Locked onto enemy ship!

00:13:41.780 --> 00:13:44.010
All right, prepare to fire
the high mega cannon!

00:13:44.010 --> 00:13:45.460
The target is the Sadalahn!

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:47.040
It's the Argama!

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:49.210
The Argama is quickly approaching
from south by southwest!

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:50.880
So it showed up.

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:55.090
The Argama has a high mega
cannon! Launch the Sadalahn!

00:13:55.090 --> 00:13:57.880
We'll retreat into Dakar's airspace!

00:13:58.050 --> 00:13:59.890
But if we--

00:13:59.890 --> 00:14:01.800
Dakar will be our shield!

00:14:01.800 --> 00:14:03.890
Otherwise, if we lift off, we'll be
cannon fodder for the Argama!

00:14:03.890 --> 00:14:04.980
Yes, my lady!

00:14:20.470 --> 00:14:23.420
It's moving northeast,
just above ground level.

00:14:23.420 --> 00:14:25.950
Northeast? Damn you, Haman.

00:14:25.950 --> 00:14:28.100
The high mega cannon's charge
is reaching critical.

00:14:28.100 --> 00:14:31.180
Not yet! Don't fire until
it leaves the city!

00:14:31.180 --> 00:14:33.250
Lady Haman is on the move!

00:14:33.250 --> 00:14:36.380
If we don't assist Glemy here, we
won't get another chance to do so!

00:14:36.380 --> 00:14:37.720
Follow me!

00:14:40.240 --> 00:14:43.020
Big Brother! Behind you!

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:47.810
- Judau!
- We brought the Core Base with us!

00:14:47.980 --> 00:14:50.110
You guys did it! Thank--

00:14:52.540 --> 00:14:55.080
August! Where have you been?!

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:58.790
The enemy's defense was a
bit stiffer than expected.

00:14:59.920 --> 00:15:01.700
Time to dock!

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:03.420
No you don't!

00:15:16.730 --> 00:15:18.590
Big Brother...

00:15:18.590 --> 00:15:21.320
Only a bit more, Big Brother.

00:15:21.320 --> 00:15:22.840
Leina...

00:15:22.840 --> 00:15:27.940
What a terrible fever. Wait here.
I'll get something to cool you off.

00:15:29.030 --> 00:15:30.820
Big Brother...

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:39.090
The Sadalahn is retreating
toward the coast!

00:15:39.090 --> 00:15:42.110
We don't have a choice!

00:15:42.110 --> 00:15:44.570
Aim the high mega cannon at
the eastern edge of Dakar!

00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:45.500
Fire!

00:15:55.940 --> 00:16:00.050
Damn the Argama... How dare
you terrorize me this way.

00:16:00.050 --> 00:16:02.770
- We're taking off, Beecha!
- All right! Let's go!

00:16:03.990 --> 00:16:05.520
Let go of me!

00:16:08.410 --> 00:16:10.440
As if I would!

00:16:12.310 --> 00:16:14.730
I'm not letting you interfere!

00:16:17.210 --> 00:16:19.990
All right, Iino! Next is the Core Top!

00:16:20.790 --> 00:16:22.420
Go!

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:23.870
Oh? Pretty good!

00:16:31.850 --> 00:16:33.960
Iino! We're transforming!

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:39.710
August?

00:16:39.710 --> 00:16:41.880
The Sadalahn has pulled back.
We are going to retreat.

00:16:42.090 --> 00:16:43.300
Hey, are you acting on your own?!

00:16:43.510 --> 00:16:45.940
Where are you looking, huh?!

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:52.230
You're too dangerous!

00:16:52.230 --> 00:16:54.940
Sorry, but I'm gonna have
to do you in, Glemy!

00:16:54.940 --> 00:16:56.570
What?!

00:16:58.290 --> 00:17:00.320
Lord Glemy!

00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:08.710
Dammit! Go down!

00:17:15.390 --> 00:17:17.590
Double Zeta!

00:17:22.060 --> 00:17:24.760
So fast! It's not just a power unit?

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:26.350
Amatha Pola!

00:17:29.970 --> 00:17:33.020
- Stop it, Pola!
- This time, for sure...!

00:17:37.060 --> 00:17:39.610
Pola, are you all right?!

00:17:42.670 --> 00:17:45.150
Zeta Gundam?! Is that Roux?!

00:17:45.150 --> 00:17:46.150
Glemy!

00:17:46.150 --> 00:17:47.590
Were you trying to shoot me down?!

00:17:47.590 --> 00:17:49.920
You're my enemy, aren't you?!

00:17:56.890 --> 00:17:58.510
So tenacious!

00:18:07.190 --> 00:18:09.890
F-Fine, Roux!

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:12.310
Roux!

00:18:12.820 --> 00:18:15.310
Do as you please, Roux.

00:18:15.310 --> 00:18:18.120
If you're the one who kills
me, I'll be satisfied.

00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:20.280
Do it, Roux!

00:18:22.370 --> 00:18:24.480
You're too soft!

00:18:24.480 --> 00:18:26.240
Glemy!

00:18:27.710 --> 00:18:29.830
Zeta Gundam!

00:18:41.810 --> 00:18:43.460
Pola's Dwadge!

00:18:43.460 --> 00:18:45.680
Which way is the Double Zeta going?

00:18:48.010 --> 00:18:51.390
Wait! Don't fall that way!

00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:57.980
- Leina!
- Leina is right there!

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:01.280
Leina!

00:19:04.710 --> 00:19:06.620
LEINA!

00:19:06.960 --> 00:19:09.080
LEINA!

00:19:17.890 --> 00:19:19.410
What is this...?

00:19:19.410 --> 00:19:23.050
All his fighting spirit is
gone, and on top of that...

00:19:29.570 --> 00:19:31.310
Leina...

00:19:32.940 --> 00:19:34.560
This is...?

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:39.610
Leina...

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:47.690
Ple!

00:19:47.690 --> 00:19:49.450
Where's Leina?

00:19:58.470 --> 00:20:00.410
Where's Leina?

00:20:00.410 --> 00:20:01.830
She was sleeping in there.

00:20:01.830 --> 00:20:03.260
By herself?

00:20:03.770 --> 00:20:07.340
Why did you leave her alone?!
I told you to stay with her!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:11.990
Leina started getting a fever,
so I wanted to cool her off.

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:15.100
I went to get a damp
cloth for her forehead.

00:20:24.580 --> 00:20:26.570
I-It's the Bawoo!

00:20:30.590 --> 00:20:33.450
Elpeo Ple?! She's alive?

00:20:38.510 --> 00:20:40.160
Glemy!

00:20:40.160 --> 00:20:41.870
Leina's dead!

00:20:41.870 --> 00:20:43.910
We don't know that yet!

00:20:43.910 --> 00:20:45.300
Judau!

00:20:45.770 --> 00:20:48.040
Is that true, Judau?

00:20:48.040 --> 00:20:51.010
Haman had already shot
Leina. She was hurt.

00:20:51.010 --> 00:20:53.420
Lady Haman?! Why did
you leave Leina alone?!

00:20:53.420 --> 00:20:55.090
I was trying to escape with her!

00:20:55.090 --> 00:20:57.560
But you guys decided to get in our way!

00:21:00.720 --> 00:21:02.520
What a turn of events!

00:21:02.520 --> 00:21:04.600
Escaping while the enemy is
right in front of your eyes...

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:06.900
Earth's people are such cowards!

00:21:08.330 --> 00:21:09.770
Elpeo Ple! Come here!

00:21:09.980 --> 00:21:10.940
NO!

00:21:10.940 --> 00:21:13.530
- Ple?
- I'm going to stay with Judau!

00:21:13.530 --> 00:21:15.830
I hate you, Glemy!

00:21:16.760 --> 00:21:18.370
Judau!

00:21:23.450 --> 00:21:26.790
What have I been doing with my life?

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:29.750
I lost Leina, and Ple rebels against me.

00:21:29.750 --> 00:21:35.000
My rank cannot be the result
of my lineage alone.

00:21:35.000 --> 00:21:37.800
Is Leina really dead...?

00:21:37.800 --> 00:21:39.550
It can't be true.

00:21:39.550 --> 00:21:41.810
Enemy reinforcements will be
here soon. We need to go.

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:42.990
NO!

00:21:42.990 --> 00:21:45.940
Leina might still be alive out there!

00:21:45.940 --> 00:21:48.440
She might still be waiting
for me to help her!

00:21:48.440 --> 00:21:50.280
I can't--

00:21:53.830 --> 00:21:56.110
Stop being such a wimp!

00:21:56.110 --> 00:21:56.900
Roux?!

00:21:56.900 --> 00:21:59.910
If you let your emotions run away
with you, then you'll die next!

00:21:59.910 --> 00:22:02.580
That would make Leina's death
completely meaningless!

00:22:02.580 --> 00:22:05.580
That's just thinking with your head!

00:22:05.580 --> 00:22:07.410
Reason's not the only
thing people act on!

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:10.420
Then what? Will you sit
here crying forever?!

00:22:10.420 --> 00:22:11.520
Judau!

00:22:11.520 --> 00:22:13.350
Let's go back to the Argama!

00:22:15.860 --> 00:22:18.720
From now on, I'll take Leina's place!

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:50.820
<i>ikuyaku ikuman ikuoku no hoshi yo
Hundreds upon thousands upon millions of stars...</i>

00:22:50.820 --> 00:22:56.950
<i>naze hikaru dake nano ka kataru chikara no shiwase
...why do you just sit there and twinkle? Show me the power that lets me connect!</i>

00:22:56.950 --> 00:23:08.050
<i>Ima nara ore demo furikaerasu ni tobitatsu kokoro
For now, even I've got a mind that wanders without reminiscing past regrets!</i>

00:23:08.940 --> 00:23:13.930
<i>Hoshi no kazu dake inochi wo takuwareba
If lives are really stored in the form of stars...</i>

00:23:14.950 --> 00:23:19.940
<i>ginga no mure no hikari wo kaete misero
...show me how to change the light and move galaxies...</i>

00:23:20.620 --> 00:23:29.650
<i>kono te ga tsukamu inochi no omosa ni naru
The weight of life itself, will be held in my hands!</i>

00:23:29.650 --> 00:23:35.530
<i>mada meinai yo sora no michishirude wa
Space's guidepost is still not within my sights...</i>

00:23:35.530 --> 00:23:41.620
<i>kono te ni saware hikari isenmanen
Let the light of 10 million years touch this hand!</i>

00:23:47.560 --> 00:23:51.920
I know this isn't Roux's fault, but
she could be more patient with us.

00:23:51.920 --> 00:23:56.300
After all, Roux's the only pilot on
the Argama who had real training.

00:23:56.300 --> 00:24:01.890
And of all things, Beecha and Mondo decide
to use Roux as bait to get close to Glemy!

00:24:02.050 --> 00:24:05.180
Roux is all mad, and Glemy is wincing!

00:24:05.180 --> 00:24:08.730
Next time on Gundam ZZ: "Runaway Roux."

00:24:05.810 --> 00:24:08.930
Next Time

00:24:05.810 --> 00:24:08.930
RUNAWAY ROUX

00:24:09.120 --> 00:24:11.900
Roux! Come back!
